JUST IN - Turkey, Saudi Arabia, and Pakistan sign Mecca Agreement defense pact: "Any military attack against any of the three countries will be viewed as an attack on all three."

The deal, which has been under negotiation since last year, marks a significant new trilateral military framework amid a deepening regional crisis following Israeli and US attacks on Iran.

